      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "While the teacher is conducting the morning session, the students are very noisy so the teacher has to shout at us to get us to quiet down.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "During this time, our teacher calls roll and gives us the announcements for the day.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "At 8:30 in the morning, we meet before class with our teacher for morning session.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "아침 8:30분에, 우리는 수업 전에 우리 선생님과 아침조회를 하기 위해 만납니다.",
      "lang": "ko"
    },
